    <node id="&quot;UNB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UnB (Universidade de Brasília) is the institution responsible for overseeing internships, including their formalization through agreements with companies."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is a federal university offering various academic programs including courses on campus and through distance education (EAD)."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is a higher education institution where courses are offered, with an ongoing curriculum structure that is updated regularly."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is a university where students can attend classes and complete their academic requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is an academic institution in Brazil, focusing on providing education and research opportunities to its students."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is an academic institution that provides education and handles administrative tasks such as issuing diplomas and managing student records."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is an educational institution that conducts admission processes and provides academic services to its students."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is an educational institution where students can study and potentially reintegrate after being expelled or withdrawn from their programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the Federal University of Brasília, a Brazilian public university known for its academic excellence and diverse educational offerings."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the University Brasília, an educational institution that handles policies and procedures for students including course credit transfers, curriculum changes, and student disenrollment."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the University of Brasília, an educational institution offering various support programs to its students."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the university where students are discussing their experiences and opportunities available for academic development and social engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is an educational institution where students matriculate and follow academic processes such as course registration, scheduling, and evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is the educational institution where students can enroll in EAD courses and participate in various academic activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is an educational institution that provides courses and coordinates student internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília, a higher education institution where students are required to register their internship through the SIGAA system."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c404738092a3fab90cd0e5ca0d0d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5219cf0817cbb82473514dd9f7028dc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab673f3f31e4b6cfe2fab27d4c223fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e957d2a51bfff9288b13b4427453063d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49989619f0773c99866fbaca6a4a26c4</data>
    </node>
