    <node id="&quot;SIGAA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An online platform used by students to manage academic activities and access various services provided by the university."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a Student Information System that provides access to various documents and information related to students' academic records."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used by students to manage their academic records, including course registration and grade checks."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used by the Universidade de Brasília for managing academic records, including stage registrations."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used by the University of Brasília for managing academic activities, including stages, through online platforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used for various academic processes, including teaching evaluations and student information management."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a university management system designed to facilitate academic activities, providing tools for students and administrators."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is an institutional portal used for student registration and course enrollment at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is an online platform used by UnB for student registration and management of academic activities, including internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is an online platform where course structures, student records, and other academic information are managed."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PPC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PPC is the pedagogical project of the course, outlining educational goals and curricular structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"PPC refers to a course plan or curriculum that students can access through the SIGAA portal."&lt;SEP&gt;"PPC stands for Pró-Reitoria de Pós-Graduação e Pesquisa, which defines rules for credits and components in the curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
