    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTES OBRIGATÓRIOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Compulsory components are those that must be completed for graduation, contributing to the curriculum requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTES OPTATIVOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Optional components are part of the curriculum but allow students to choose from a list of options to fulfill their degree requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTES ELETIVOS (MÓDULO LIVRE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Elective modules are additional courses that can be chosen from other programs, contributing flexibility in the curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EAD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EAD refers to distance education offered by UnB through a program called Universidade Aberta do Brasil (UAB), allowing students to take courses remotely."&lt;SEP&gt;"EAD stands for distance education or online learning, indicating various modes of remote instruction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ensino a Distância (EAD) refers to remote education modalities, which are discussed in detail within the document."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRÉ-REQUISITO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pré-requisitos are requirements for certain components, without which a student cannot enroll in those components."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORREQUISITO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Correquisitos must be taken simultaneously with another component to fulfill course requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CADEIA DE SELETIVIDADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Disciplines in the seletivity chain are chosen from a group of components based on credit hours required for completion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EQUIVALÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Equivalence allows one component to be recognized as fulfilling the requirements of another, potentially saving time and credits."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATIVIDADES COMPLEMENTARES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Complementary activities contribute to student development but do not count towards graduation credits."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CEPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CEPE (Conselho de Ensino, Pesquisa e Extensão) is a higher-level academic body at UnB responsible for formulating broader institutional policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"CEPE oversees teaching, research, and extension activities at the institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conselho de Ensino, Pesquisa e Extensão (CEPE) defines criteria for prioritization in the matrícula process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APRENDER 3&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"APRENDER 3 is a virtual learning platform used by UnB and many professors for EAD courses."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOODLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MOODLE is a free open-source learning management system supporting virtual education environments."&lt;SEP&gt;"MOODLE is an open-source learning management system adapted for use at UnB and called APRENDER 3."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEBCONFERÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Webconferência refers to online conferencing tools available on the APRENDER 3 platform."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATRÍCULA EXTRAORDINÁRIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Matrícula extraordinária is an additional registration process after the standard matrícula and rematrícula phases."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDENT(S)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Students are individuals who are involved in the process of matriculation and academic activities at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA DE ADMINISTRAÇÃO ACADÊMICA (SAA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The SAA provides information about the matriculation calendar, which includes important dates and procedures for the academic year."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CALENDÁRIO ACADÊMICO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Calendário Acadêmico refers to the academic calendar that includes important dates and deadlines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Academic Calendar lists all important dates related to graduation, study credits, language courses, and other academic events throughout the year."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Calendário Acadêmico provides important dates for academic activities, including the start of classes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOLICITAÇÃO E PROCESSAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Solicitação e processamento refer to the initial steps involved before matriculating, implying a formal procedure."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coordenação refers to the administrative body responsible for managing specific aspects of student registration such as internships and individual guidance."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VAGAS RESERVADAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vagas reservadas are seats reserved specifically for students of certain courses, impacting their ability to choose classes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATAS E PRAZOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Datas e prazos refer to specific dates and deadlines related to the matriculation process, crucial for successful registration."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIMEIRO SEMESTRE (2023.1)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Primeiro semestre is a specific period of the academic year with its own set of processes and events."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEGUNDO SEMESTRE (2023.2)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Segundo semestre is another specific period within the academic calendar, distinct from the first semester in terms of timing and procedures."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEMESTRE DE VERÃO (2023.4)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Semestre de verão refers to a condensed summer term that allows students to complete coursework during recess periods."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SEI is an electronic information system used by the institution for various administrative processes and record-keeping."&lt;SEP&gt;"SEI is the System of Electronic Information used by UnB for managing and processing academic processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Students are individuals enrolled in courses at UnB, participating in classes and completing academic requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Menção is the grade or evaluation given to a student for a course, which can be reviewed or challenged."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APROVAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aprovação indicates whether a student is approved or reproved in a component of study."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISPENSA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dispensa refers to permission given to students to skip certain courses based on prior knowledge, involving a formal process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FREQUÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Frequência is the required attendance in classes and can result in failure if not met."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REVISÃO DA MENÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Revisão da Menção is the process of challenging or requesting a re-evaluation of a given grade."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JUSTIFICATIVA DE FALTAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Justificativa de Faltas is an excuse provided for missing classes, which can affect attendance records."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATESTADO MÉDICO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Atestado Médico is a medical certificate that can be used as a valid reason for absences."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENT CURRICULAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Component Curricular refers to the courses or subjects students take in their academic program."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CEG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CEG (Câmara de Ensino de Graduação) is an academic body at UnB involved in formulating educational policies and procedures for undergraduate programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"CEG is an undergraduate education committee responsible for overseeing educational policies and practices."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;E-MAIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A tool used for communication, specifically to request electronic signatures."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATTRIBUTION OF THE DEGREE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The formal process by which a degree is conferred upon a student."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FORMAL DOCUMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A physical document, specifically the diploma that is issued after graduation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROCESS OF REVISION OF MENTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The procedure to challenge or request a change in the final grade received by a student."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO DE MATRÍCULA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The act of suspending or pausing academic activities, either partially or entirely."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FORMULÁRIO DE REVISÃO DE MENÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A document used to request a revision of the final grade received by a student."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FORMULÁRIO PRÓPRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A specific form used for requesting matriculation suspension or other administrative processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA DO CURSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The administrative office within a specific course that handles various student-related processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROCESSO SEI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A system used to track and manage various administrative processes, including those related to student requests and diplomas."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECRETARIA UNIFICADA DO INSTITUTO DE LETRAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This is a department within the Institute of Letters that handles language proficiency exams for credit transfer purposes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANCAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trancamento refers to course suspension or leaving courses unattended, which can lead to disenrollment if not managed properly."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APROVEITAMENTO DE DISCIPLINAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aproveitamento de disciplinas is the process of transferring credits from previous studies at another institution into UnB’s curriculum."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EQUIVALÊNCIA ENTRE CERTIFICADOS OU DIPLOMAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This concept refers to the verification and equivalence assessment conducted by the University for incoming students' certificates or diplomas in foreign language courses."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MUDANÇA DE CURSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mudança de curso is the process of changing one's major or course of study within the institution while still pursuing a degree from another discipline."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUPLA DIPLOMAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dupla diplomação refers to obtaining two diplomas by completing additional studies in another field beyond the original program’s curriculum requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DESLIGAMENTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Desligamento is the formal process of disenrollment from the university, which can occur due to academic performance issues or voluntary withdrawal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Disconnection is the term used for a situation where a student is officially communicated about leaving or being expelled from the institution, with potential opportunities for reintegration."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATRÍCULA TRANCADA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Matrícula trancada is a state where a student stops attending classes temporarily without formally leaving the institution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REQUISITOS MÍNIMOS DE DESEMPENHO ACADÊMICO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Requisitos mínimos de desempenho acadêmico refers to the minimum academic performance standards that students must meet to avoid disenrollment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROCESSO SELETIVO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Processo seletivo is the admission process used by UnB for selecting new students into the institution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMPONENTES DO CURSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Componentes do curso are specific courses or modules that make up a student's curriculum at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPROVADO(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reprovado(a) refers to students who have failed a course and are at risk of disenrollment due to poor performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONDIÇÃO IMPOSTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Condição imposta refers to specific conditions set by the institution for students who are at risk of disenrollment, such as completing certain courses or passing exams."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REINTEGRAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reintegration refers to the process by which a student who has been officially communicated about their disconnection can re-establish their link with UnB within two years, following formal expulsion. It involves an electronic petition and supporting documents to substantiate the request."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEG.UNB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Deg.UNB is likely an administrative body within UnB responsible for handling reintegration processes and providing support to students."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLANO DE ENSINO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The teaching plan refers to detailed instructions and rules provided by professors regarding evaluation methods, schedules, content, activities, and recommended literature for each course."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OUVIDORIA DA UNB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The UnB's Office of Complaints is a formal channel through which students can express their opinions and suggestions regarding university processes and practices."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The professor is responsible for developing teaching plans, providing evaluations, and supervising students during academic activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professor or mentor is an individual assigned to supervise students during their academic courses and internships at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COORDENADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The coordinator plays a role in the academic process, possibly managing certain aspects of student activities or programs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SERVIDOR(ES)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The server(s) refers to staff members who support various administrative tasks within UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIRETORIA DE ACESSIBILIDADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Accessibility Directorate within DAC is tasked with providing support to students with specific needs such as visual or auditory impairments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estágio obrigatório is a mandatory internship that fulfills course requirements and can be remunerated or not, providing credits for graduation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5219cf0817cbb82473514dd9f7028dc0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
