      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DEG oversees educational matters at UnB, including internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"DEG, part of UnB, is responsible for overseeing the administration and coordination of graduation-related matters, including internship management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decanato de Ensino de Graduação (DEG) é um departamento da UnB responsável por gerenciar aspectos acadêmicos e regulatórios dos estágios."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decanato de Ensino de Graduação is a division within UnB responsible for undergraduate education management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação (DEG) at UnB coordinates educational matters including the supervision and management of students' academic progress."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação (DEG) coordinates academic support initiatives such as Tutoria de Graduação and oversees the selection of tutors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação at UnB oversees the management of undergraduate education, including stage-related procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação is a department within UnB responsible for overseeing academic matters related to undergraduate education."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação is part of UnB, responsible for undergraduate education."</data>
