    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA (UNB)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Universidade de Brasília is an academic institution responsible for overseeing graduation, coordination of stages and other administrative tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília is an educational institution that manages and oversees the regulations and processes related to student internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília is the institution that has implemented policies and regulations related to internships, including the Regulation on Undergraduate Internship General Rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is a higher education institution that regulates and oversees the stages of its students, providing policies, guidelines, and support for both mandatory and non-mandatory stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is a higher education institution where students are managing their internships and following the rules of their academic program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is an educational institution providing guidelines for managing stages and interacting with students during their academic journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"Universidade de Brasília is an educational institution where academic and administrative units are managing student internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </node>
