      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DAIA is responsible for student support and integration at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"DAIA, another division within UnB, handles academic accompaniment and integration processes related to internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) é um departamento da UnB responsável por supervisão e integração acadêmica dos discentes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica manages student integration and academic support at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) at UnB manages the integration and follow-up of students within their academic environment, particularly in relation to internships and stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica at UnB is responsible for guiding students and ensuring their integration into academic activities, particularly stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica is a department within UnB that oversees academic integration and guidance for students."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica is an organizational unit of UnB that deals with the integration and support of students in their academic and professional development."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
