    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE RESCISÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Termo de Rescisão is a document related to the termination of an existing agreement, such as a TCE."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELATÓRIOS DE ATIVIDADES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Relatórios de Atividades are reports that students must submit detailing their internship activities and experiences."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INSPIRA UNB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SYSTEM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Inspira UnB is an online system used by students to manage their academic and administrative tasks at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OS ESTÁGIOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Os estágios referem-se a componentes curriculares obrigatórios e não obrigatórios no qual os alunos devem participar, geralmente regidos por leis e normativas."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO CURRICULAR OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estágio Curricular Obrigatório é um componente do currículo que o(a) discente precisa cursar para integralizar a carga horária e concluir o curso, sem contrapartida de empresa/escola."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNB - UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UnB é a instituição de ensino que regula as normas para os estágios e possui convênios com empresas para oferecer estágios curriculares obrigatórios."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEI DE ESTÁGIO Nº 11.788/2008&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lei de Estágio nº 11.788/2008 é uma lei federal que regula o estágio não gera vínculo empregatício e estabelece requisitos legais para os estágios."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESOLUÇÃO CEPE Nº 104/2021&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Resolução CEPE nº 104/2021 é uma normativa interna da UnB que detalha os requisitos e procedimentos para a formalização do Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TCE is a document that must be formalized before starting an internship, detailing the commitment between student, company, and UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) é um documento oficial que estabelece as cláusulas e requisitos para a realização do estágio, assinado por discente, empresa/escola, supervisor(a), e professor(a) orientador(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCE is a document that must be registered at least 10 days before the internship starts to allow for formalization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Termo de Compromisso de Estágio is a legal document that outlines the terms, conditions, and responsibilities of all parties involved in an internship program at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEGURO CONTRA ACIDENTES PESSOAIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Seguro contra acidentes pessoais é uma contrapartida obrigatória para estágios não curriculares obrigatórios, fornecido pelo UnB; para os curriculares não obrigatórios, deve ser fornecido pela empresa."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLANO DE ATIVIDADES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plano de Atividades é um documento que detalha as atividades a serem realizadas durante o estágio e deve estar alinhado com a formação do discente."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Plano de Atividades is a document that outlines the specific tasks and objectives assigned to a student during their internship, designed to align with their academic goals and the company's needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Plano de Atividades is part of the TCE and needs to be filled out accurately as it affects the registration process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A discente refers to a student involved in an educational process, particularly engaged in stages and their management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Discente refers to a student at UnB who needs to follow the steps described for registering their internship in SIGAA."&lt;SEP&gt;"Discente refers to a student managing their academic and internship processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Discente é o estudante matriculado no curso que realiza os estágios, tendo direitos e obrigações definidos na lei e normativas da UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"Discente é o(a) estudante matriculado(a) no curso que realiza os estágios, tendo direitos e obrigações definidos na lei e normativas da UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The discente refers to a student who is initiating the internship registration process, following specific guidelines from UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPRESA/ESCOLA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Empresa/Escola é uma entidade que oferece estágios para discentes, com ou sem contrapartida em termos de bolsa e vale transporte."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Professor(a) Orientador(a) is an academic advisor who signs the TCE and supports the discente during the internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"A professor or advisor who is guiding a student through their stage process."&lt;SEP&gt;"A professor who will sign the TCE or other documents related to the internship process."&lt;SEP&gt;"A professor(a) orientador(a) is an academic mentor from UnB who oversees and evaluates the activities of a student during their internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"O Professor(a) Orientador(a) é responsável pelo acompanhamento acadêmico do discente durante o estágio, analisando seu plano de atividades."&lt;SEP&gt;"Professor(a) orientador(a) is an advisor professor guiding students during the internship process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A) NO CAMPO DE ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Supervisor(a) no campo de estágio é um profissional com formação equivalente ou igual ao curso do discente, responsável por orientar e acompanhar o desempenho do discente durante a realização das atividades estabelecidas."&lt;SEP&gt;"The supervisor(a) no campo de estágio refers to the professional in the company who guides and monitors the work of a student during an internship, ensuring that it aligns with both the company's needs and the academic program's objectives."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CESG coordinates the internship process within UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) é uma unidade administrativa da UnB responsável pela gestão e coordenação dos estágios curriculares."&lt;SEP&gt;"Coordenação de Estágios is an administrative unit under DAIA responsible for managing internships and their documentation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) within DAIA is specifically responsible for the coordination and management of student internships and stages, ensuring proper documentation and compliance with regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios is a sub-unit within DAIA dedicated to managing and coordinating internship programs for undergraduate students at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios is part of DAIA, managing internship processes for students at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios within DAIA manages stage-related processes, providing detailed instructions to students and supervisors."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPRESA/CONCEDENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The company or institution where the student will perform their internship, which needs to be registered in SIGAA."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEG - DECANATO DE ENSINO DE GRADUAÇÃO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The DEG at UnB oversees academic teaching, including internship coordination and supervision policies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAIA - DIRETORIA DE ACOMPANHAMENTO E INTEGRAÇÃO ACADÊMICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DAIA is part of UnB's administrative structure that focuses on student integration and support programs, particularly regarding internships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CESG - COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CESG coordinates internship activities at UnB, managing the supervision process for students."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Termo de Compromisso is a document or agreement to be signed by professors, formalizing their role in supervising students during internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Termo de Compromisso is a document that needs to be signed by the student, their professor, and the company."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estágio refers to student internships or practical training experiences at the Universidade de Brasília."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Estágio refers to an internship or practical training program as part of the graduation course."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE RESCISÃO OU CANCELAMENTO DO ESTÁGIO NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A document used to officially cancel an optional internship, typically requiring signatures from the company representative, supervisor, and the student."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VISUALIZAR ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An online tool or feature in SIGAA that allows students to view detailed information about their stage process, including download access to important documents like the Termo de Compromisso de Estágio."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTAGIÁRIO(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An estagiário(a) refers to the student who participates in an internship program, either mandatory or non-mandatory, under the supervision of a professor from their institution and a supervisor in the company."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEI FEDERAL 11.788/2008&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LEGAL_DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Lei de Estágio 11.788/2008 is a federal law that governs all aspects of internship programs, providing legal framework for the protection and rights of both students and employers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Obrigatório refers to a mandatory component/curricular activity where students must pass with approval to complete their course requirements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Não Obrigatório is an optional curricular activity that requires the company's support, such as a stipend and transportation benefits."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNB (UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UnB is an educational institution that manages the process of registering and activating internships through its systems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The supervisor of an internship plays a crucial role in signing the terms and agreements related to the internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONCEDENTE (COMPANY)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The concedente is a company that provides the internship opportunity, needing to be registered with UnB for formalization."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGAA (SISTEMA INTEGRADO DE GESTÃO ACADÊMICA E ADMINISTRATIVA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SIGAA is an online system used by UnB for registering and managing internships, providing a platform for pre-cadastro."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONVÊNIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Convênio is necessary to formalize the relationship between the company (concedente) and the university (UnB)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMAIL (CONVENIOESTAGIO@UNB.BR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMMUNICATION TOOL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The email address for convenioestagio@unb.br is used for companies to inquire about formalizing a convênio with UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROJETO PEDAGÓGICO DO CURSO (PPC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Projeto Pedagógico do Curso (PPC) outlines the educational goals and curriculum of a course at UnB."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPRESENTANTE DA EMPRESA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Representante da empresa refers to a company representative involved in the student's internship process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Supervisor(a) is an academic supervisor guiding students during their internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </node>
