      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The UnB has policies and regulations for managing both mandatory and non-mandatory internships, setting standards for supervisors and ensuring proper integration of students."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'estagiário(a)' is used within the context of the Universidade de Brasília, referring to students participating in internships or stages."</data>
      <data key="d5">"academic supervision, internship management"&lt;SEP&gt;"student role"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA (UNB)&quot;" target="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The TCE is a legal document that must be signed by all parties involved in an internship program under the regulation of UnB."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legal documentation, responsibility"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIRETORIA DE ACOMPANHAMENTO E INTEGRAÇÃO ACADÊMICA (DAIA)&quot;" target="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) trabalha em conjunto com a Coordenação de Estágios para monitorar e integrar os discentes."&lt;SEP&gt;"CESG operates under the Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica."</data>
      <data key="d5">"integration, collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"sub-department, organizational hierarchy"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIRETORIA DE ACOMPANHAMENTO E INTEGRAÇÃO ACADÊMICA (DAIA)&quot;" target="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica oversees the students' integration and guidance in their academic programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Students are managed by the Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica in their academic and internship processes."</data>
      <data key="d5">"guidance, integration"&lt;SEP&gt;"student management, oversight"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIRETORIA DE ACOMPANHAMENTO E INTEGRAÇÃO ACADÊMICA (DAIA)&quot;" target="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica supports and manages the integration of students into their internships."</data>
      <data key="d5">"student support"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTÁGIOS CURRICULARES OBRIGATÓRIOS&quot;" target="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The TCE documents are crucial for managing the mandatory internships, ensuring compliance with graduation requirements."</data>
      <data key="d5">"graduation requirement, documentation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTÁGIOS CURRICULARES OBRIGATÓRIOS&quot;" target="&quot;RELATÓRIOS DE ATIVIDADES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Students must submit Relatórios de Atividades as part of their mandatory internships to document their experiences and progress."</data>
      <data key="d5">"reporting, accountability"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTÁGIO CURRICULAR OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;" target="&quot;UNB - UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O Estágio Curricular Obrigatório é regido pela UnB, que possui convênios com empresas para oferecer estágios curriculares obrigatórios."</data>
      <data key="d5">"regulation, cooperation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNB - UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA&quot;" target="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) é formalizado pela UnB e envolve discente, empresa, supervisor(a), e professor(a) orientador(a)."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legal framework, documentation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNB - UNIVERSIDADE DE BRASÍLIA&quot;" target="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O Discente está vinculado à UnB, que regula os estágios e oferece suporte legal e normativo para a realização dos mesmos."</data>
      <data key="d5">"education, regulation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The professor's approval of the TCE is necessary to ensure that the internship aligns with academic goals."</data>
      <data key="d5">"approval, coordination"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;" target="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The discente must register the TCE with SIGAA, which requires a specific timeline for formalization before the internship starts."</data>
      <data key="d5">"registration process, formalization"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PLANO DE ATIVIDADES&quot;" target="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Plano de Atividades is part of the TCE that the discente must complete and register in SIGAA."</data>
      <data key="d5">"document completion, registration"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">81.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Discente" is guided by the "Professor(a) orientador(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"O Professor(a) Orientador(a) é responsável pelo acompanhamento acadêmico do discente durante o estágio, analisando seu plano de atividades."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Professor(a) Orientador(a) assists the discente in completing and signing the TCE document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Professor(a) Orientador(a) will sign the TCE document for the Discente."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student must communicate with and submit documents to the professor or advisor for guidance and approval during the stage process."</data>
      <data key="d5">"academic supervision, mentorship"&lt;SEP&gt;"advisory support, documentation completion"&lt;SEP&gt;"guidance, communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"mentorship, guidance"&lt;SEP&gt;"registration management, mentorship"&lt;SEP&gt;"supervision, academic support"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A) NO CAMPO DE ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O Supervisor(a) no campo de estágio é responsável por acompanhar e orientar o discente durante a realização das atividades estabelecidas pelo Plano de Atividades."</data>
      <data key="d5">"supervision, field guidance"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;EMPRESA/CONCEDENTE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Discente needs to register the Empresa/Concedente in SIGAA before starting the internship."</data>
      <data key="d5">"registration process, company registration"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;TERMO DE RESCISÃO OU CANCELAMENTO DO ESTÁGIO NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A discente must submit this document if they need to cancel an optional internship, often involving multiple signatures."</data>
      <data key="d5">"documentation submission, process compliance"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The supervisor assists the discente in completing the necessary documentation for the internship and signs related agreements."</data>
      <data key="d5">"guidance, support"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Coordenação de Estágios manages students' internship processes at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"Students are managed by the Coordenação de Estágios in their internship processes."</data>
      <data key="d5">"internship management, oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, oversight"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;REPRESENTANTE DA EMPRESA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Discente interacts with the company representative during their internship."</data>
      <data key="d5">"interaction, collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Discente is supervised by the supervisor during their internship."</data>
      <data key="d5">"supervision, mentorship"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;" target="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The professor or mentor will sign the Termo de Compromisso, formalizing their role in supervising students during internships."</data>
      <data key="d5">"supervision agreement, formal documentation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;" target="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The professor or mentor is responsible for overseeing the student's internship (Estágio)."</data>
      <data key="d5">"academic supervision, mentorship"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A) NO CAMPO DE ESTÁGIO&quot;" target="&quot;ESTAGIÁRIO(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The supervisor plays a crucial role in guiding and supporting the student during their internship."</data>
      <data key="d5">"guidance, support"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;" target="&quot;RELATÓRIO PERIÓDICO OU FINAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Coordenação de Estágios is responsible for managing the filling and submission of periodic or final reports, as required by the Lei 11.788/2008."</data>
      <data key="d5">"report management"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;" target="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Coordenação de Estágios is responsible for managing and overseeing the internship process."</data>
      <data key="d5">"internship management"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO&quot;" target="&quot;ESTAGIÁRIO(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Students need to sign the Termo de Compromisso with their professor and company as part of the internship process."</data>
      <data key="d5">"document signing, legal requirements"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a6bd9c133e851de0c23f808943eeda2d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;" target="&quot;RELATÓRIO PERIÓDICO OU FINAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Students are required to submit periodic or final reports during their internship as per the Lei 11.788/2008."</data>
      <data key="d5">"report submission requirement"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VISUALIZAR ESTÁGIO&quot;" target="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO ASSINADO PELAS PARTES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Visualizar Estágio' tool provides access to the signed Termo de Compromisso de Estágio, allowing students to download and manage their documents."</data>
      <data key="d5">"document management, access rights"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTAGIÁRIO(A)&quot;" target="&quot;OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The mandatory stage has specific requirements for students to pass with approval before completing their course."</data>
      <data key="d5">"requirement, completion"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTAGIÁRIO(A)&quot;" target="&quot;NÃO OBRIGATÓRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Non-mandatory stages involve additional agreements with companies for support such as stipends and transportation benefits."</data>
      <data key="d5">"support agreement, stipend"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CONVÊNIO&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY (CONCEDENTE)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Companies must formalize a convênio with UnB to be eligible for offering internships."</data>
      <data key="d5">"registration process, agreement"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
